		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A horse-sized, night-black, six- legged lizard that drips acid from two rows of teeth.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d6 + petrify), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending near from dracolisk. DEX 15+ or 2d8 damage. Organic material or metal hit dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Acidblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Petrify</strong>. Any creature that touches the dracolisk or meets its gaze, CON 15+ or petrified.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
